   "source": [
    "In this notebook, we generate a DEM for unflagged Steane code syndrome extraction with a standard depolarizing noise model. The plan is to use the set of DEM events as the set of \"core\" bit strings we are most concerned about capturing in simulation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "be1f4d1f-955d-48f3-80b2-9d2829d02321",
